---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Dima Perkis"
  description="Recovering strategy consultant with newfound AI superpowers. I help people see what AI suddenly makes possible, build the first real version together, and keep going on their own."
  defaultTheme="light"
>
  <main class="home-shell">
    <section class="masthead" aria-labelledby="home-title">
      <div class="identity-lockup" aria-label="Dima Perkis">
        <img
          class="identity-mark"
          src="/images/brand/dima-dima-dima/dima-mark-concept-01-transparent.png"
          alt=""
          aria-hidden="true"
        />
        <div class="identity-words">
          <h1 id="home-title" class="identity-first">DIMA</h1>
          <div class="identity-last">PERKIS</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="masthead-copy">
        <p class="masthead-kicker">Recovering strategy consultant with newfound AI superpowers</p>
        <h2>I turn “what if?” into something real</h2>
        <p class="masthead-explainer">I uncover the friction, create the lightbulb moment, and use AI to bring the first working solution to life in hours or days—not months. Then I help the people around it learn how to harness those same tools for their own work, lives, and projects.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="thinking-section" aria-labelledby="thinking-title">
      <div class="thinking-intro">
        <p class="section-label">How I work</p>
        <h2 id="thinking-title">From friction to something real</h2>
        <p>The same pattern shows up whether I’m helping a builder find new work or getting my family out of the house</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="thinking-loop">
        <li>
          <span>01</span>
          <div><strong>Uncover the friction</strong><p>Find the annoying workaround, stuck decision, or possibility nobody has made concrete yet</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>02</span>
          <div><strong>Create the lightbulb moment</strong><p>Use a map, render, or working prototype to make the opportunity obvious: “Wait—we can do that?”</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>03</span>
          <div><strong>Bring it to life</strong><p>Iterate with AI in hours or days, use judgment to decide what matters, and leave people able to keep building</p></div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="work-heading" aria-labelledby="selected-work-title">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">In the real world</p>
        <h2 id="selected-work-title">Things I’m building and using</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/projects">All projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </section>

    <section class="portfolio-grid" aria-label="Featured projects">
      <article class="project-card project-card--feature card-groundline">
        <div class="card-media card-media--groundline comparison-preview" aria-label="A real yard before and after an AI-assisted landscaping concept">
          <img class="comparison-before" src="/groundline/img/client-entry-before.jpg" alt="The existing front entry before a new landscaping concept" />
          <img class="comparison-after" src="/groundline/img/client-entry-concept.jpg" alt="The same home with an AI-assisted landscaping concept" />
          <span class="comparison-handle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="comparison-label comparison-label--before">Before</span>
          <span class="comparison-label comparison-label--after">Reimagined</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-copy">
          <span class="card-kicker">Building now · AI growth for trades</span>
          <div class="card-title-row"><h2>Groundline</h2></div>
          <p>I’m exploring how AI can help builders and high-end trades spot growth opportunities, make them visible, and build the first working system with their team.</p>
          <div class="card-actions">
            <a class="card-action-primary" href="/projects/groundline-ai-growth">Read the field notes →</a>
            <a href="/groundline/index.html">Open concept →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card card-permit">
        <div class="card-media">
          <img src="/groundline/img/mock-targeting-map.png" alt="A property targeting map with candidate homes and nearby completed work" />
        </div>
        <div class="card-copy">
          <span class="card-kicker">Data investigation</span>
          <div class="card-title-row"><h2>Permit Propensity</h2></div>
          <p>I’m testing whether public permit and real-estate data can reveal new opportunities and better leads for high-end trades.</p>
          <dl class="permit-stats" aria-label="Permit Propensity data collected">
            <div><dt>8,701</dt><dd>Permit records</dd></div>
            <div><dt>7</dt><dd>Source pipelines</dd></div>
            <div><dt>143,031</dt><dd>Parcels</dd></div>
            <div><dt>97,446</dt><dd>Valuations</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <div class="card-actions">
            <a class="card-action-primary" href="/projects/permit-propensity">Read the project →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card project-card--feature card-dewey">
        <div class="card-media card-media--dewey">
          <img src="/images/dewey/dewey-check-list.png" alt="Dewey checking a reading list against the library catalog" />
        </div>
        <div class="card-copy">
          <span class="card-kicker">Featured build</span>
          <div class="card-title-row"><h2>Dewey</h2></div>
          <p>Family book recommendations, checked live against Fulton County Library inventory.</p>
          <div class="card-actions">
            <a class="card-action-primary" href="https://dimadimadima.com/dewey" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Dewey ↗</a>
            <a href="/projects/dewey">Project notes →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="radar-card">
        <div class="radar-brand">
          <span class="radar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="odr-home-grad" x1="4" y1="4" x2="36" y2="36" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                  <stop offset="0" stop-color="#C2410C"></stop>
                  <stop offset="1" stop-color="#B45309"></stop>
                </linearGradient>
                <linearGradient id="odr-home-sweep" x1="20" y1="20" x2="36.9" y2="13.8" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                  <stop offset="0" stop-color="#C2410C" stop-opacity="0"></stop>
                  <stop offset="1" stop-color="#C2410C" stop-opacity=".28"></stop>
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
              <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="17.5" fill="none" stroke="url(#odr-home-grad)" stroke-width="2"></circle>
              <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="11.5" fill="none" stroke="url(#odr-home-grad)" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".5"></circle>
              <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="5.5" fill="none" stroke="url(#odr-home-grad)" stroke-width="1.1" opacity=".35"></circle>
              <g class="radar-sweep">
                <path d="M20 20 L20 2.5 A17.5 17.5 0 0 1 36.9 13.8 Z" fill="url(#odr-home-sweep)"></path>
                <line x1="20" y1="20" x2="36.9" y2="13.8" stroke="url(#odr-home-grad)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></line>
              </g>
              <circle cx="31.8" cy="15.6" r="3" fill="#B45309"></circle>
              <circle cx="31.8" cy="15.6" r="3" fill="none" stroke="#B45309" stroke-width="1.5" opacity=".35"></circle>
              <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="1.7" fill="url(#odr-home-grad)"></circle>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span>On Dima’s Radar · Live in Atlanta</span>
        </div>
        <div class="radar-title-row">
          <h2>Happening in Atlanta</h2>
        </div>
        <div id="atl-live-list" class="radar-list">
          <div class="radar-empty">Loading the radar…</div>
        </div>
        <p class="radar-foot">The project I use to turn “we should hang out” into an actual plan: Atlanta events scraped wide, scored against my taste, and ready to send as an invite.</p>
        <div class="card-actions radar-actions">
          <a class="card-action-primary" href="https://dimadimadima.com/atl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Radar ↗</a>
          <a href="/projects/atl-radar">Project notes →</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card card-brain">
        <div class="card-media"><img src="/images/brain-ops/dashboard-overview.png" alt="Brain Ops dashboard showing automation health and freshness" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="card-copy">
          <span class="card-kicker">System I run</span>
          <div class="card-title-row"><h2>Brain Ops</h2></div>
          <p>18 automated jobs, one dashboard, and the difference between “alive” and “actually processing.”</p>
          <div class="card-actions"><a class="card-action-primary" href="/projects/brain-ops">Open the dashboard →</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card card-toddlermaps">
        <div class="card-media"><img src="/images/toddlermaps/toddlermaps-overview-map.png" alt="ToddlerMaps printable neighborhood map" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="card-copy">
          <span class="card-kicker">Family tool</span>
          <div class="card-title-row"><h2>ToddlerMaps</h2></div>
          <p>Navigation translated into landmarks a toddler actually knows.</p>
          <div class="card-actions"><a class="card-action-primary" href="https://dimadimadima.com/toddlermaps" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open app ↗</a><a href="/projects/toddlermaps">Details →</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card card-suno">
        <div class="card-media card-media--suno suno-preview-grid" aria-label="Animated artwork from recent family songs">
          <video data-hover-video src="/videos/suno/skibidub-never-stop-preview.mp4" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"></video>
          <video data-hover-video src="/videos/suno/ra-ra-waffle-time-preview.mp4" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"></video>
          <img src="/videos/suno/ruby-ole.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/videos/suno/breakin-out-the-breakfast.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="play-button" aria-hidden="true">♪</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-copy">
          <span class="card-kicker">Family songs</span>
          <div class="card-title-row"><h2>Inside jokes with a soundtrack</h2></div>
          <p>Suno turns a toddler phrase, breakfast ritual, or family memory into something we all sing in the car.</p>
          <div class="card-actions">
            <a class="card-action-primary" href="https://suno.com/@dimadimadimadima" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Play the songs ↗</a>
            <a href="/projects/suno-factory">How I make them →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card card-music">
        <div class="card-media"><img src="/images/spotify-hero.png" alt="Dima’s music listening analysis" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="card-copy">
          <span class="card-kicker">Personal data</span>
          <div class="card-title-row"><h2>Music Data</h2></div>
          <p>18 years, 147,594 streams, and 178 concerts—visualized.</p>
          <div class="card-actions"><a class="card-action-primary" href="https://dima-spotify.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open site ↗</a><a href="/projects/spotify-analysis">Details →</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      function renderRadar() {
        try {
          var list = document.getElementById('atl-live-list');
          if (!list || typeof EVENTS === 'undefined') return;
          var today = new Date();
          today.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);
          var upcoming = EVENTS
            .filter(function (event) { return new Date(event.dateEnd || event.date) >= today; })
            .sort(function (a, b) { return (b.score || 0) - (a.score || 0); })
            .slice(0, 14)
            .sort(function (a, b) { return new Date(a.date) - new Date(b.date); })
            .slice(0, 3);
          if (!upcoming.length) return;
          list.innerHTML = upcoming.map(function (event) {
            var isAbsolute = event.imageUrl && /^https?:\/\//i.test(event.imageUrl);
            var imageSrc = event.imageUrl ? (isAbsolute ? event.imageUrl : '/atl/' + event.imageUrl) : null;
            var thumbnail = imageSrc
              ? '<img class="radar-thumb" src="' + imageSrc + '" alt="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.outerHTML=\'<span class=&quot;radar-thumb radar-thumb--emoji&quot;>' + (event.emoji || '📅') + '</span>\'">'
              : '<span class="radar-thumb radar-thumb--emoji">' + (event.emoji || '📅') + '</span>';
            return '<div class="radar-row">'
              + thumbnail
              + '<span class="radar-event"><span class="radar-name">' + event.title + '</span>'
              + '<span class="radar-venue">' + event.dateStr + ' · ' + (event.venue || '') + '</span></span>'
              + '</div>';
          }).join('');
        } catch (error) { /* keep the loading fallback */ }
      }

      function loadRadar() {
        var script = document.createElement('script');
        script.src = '/atl/data.js';
        script.onload = renderRadar;
        document.body.appendChild(script);
      }

      if ('requestIdleCallback' in window) requestIdleCallback(loadRadar);
      else setTimeout(loadRadar, 250);

      document.querySelectorAll('[data-hover-video]').forEach(function (video) {
        var card = video.closest('.card-suno');
        if (!card) return;
        card.addEventListener('mouseenter', function () { video.play().catch(function () {}); });
        card.addEventListener('mouseleave', function () { video.pause(); video.currentTime = 0; });
        card.addEventListener('focusin', function () { video.play().catch(function () {}); });
        card.addEventListener('focusout', function () { video.pause(); video.currentTime = 0; });
      });
    })();
  </script>
</Layout>

<style>
  .home-shell { padding: 2rem 0 5rem; }

  .masthead {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(18rem, .95fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
    align-items: center;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 84%, transparent);
  }

  .identity-lockup {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: clamp(.9rem, 1.7vw, 1.25rem);
    width: max-content;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .identity-mark {
    width: clamp(8.75rem, 16vw, 10rem);
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .identity-words {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: .04em;
    padding: .02em 0;
  }
  .identity-first,
  .identity-last {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -.055em;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.1rem);
    line-height: .83;
  }
  .identity-last { margin: 0; }

  .masthead-copy { max-width: 34rem; }
  .masthead-copy .masthead-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 .65rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .07em;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .masthead-copy h2 {
    margin: 0 0 .8rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.1rem);
    letter-spacing: -.055em;
    line-height: .98;
  }
  .masthead-copy .masthead-explainer {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: clamp(.98rem, 1.8vw, 1.08rem);
    line-height: 1.68;
  }
  .thinking-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(15rem, .68fr) minmax(0, 1.32fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    margin-top: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .thinking-intro h2 { margin: .5rem 0 .8rem; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 2.55rem); letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: 1.02; }
  .thinking-intro > p:last-child { max-width: 28rem; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .thinking-loop { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .thinking-loop li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2.25rem 1fr; gap: .9rem; padding: 1.15rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .thinking-loop li:first-child { padding-top: 0; border-top: 0; }
  .thinking-loop li:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .thinking-loop li > span { color: var(--gold); font: 500 .67rem/1.5 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .thinking-loop strong { display: block; margin-bottom: .25rem; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1rem; }
  .thinking-loop p { max-width: 38rem; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; line-height: 1.55; }

  .work-heading {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 4rem 0 1.35rem;
  }
  .section-label,
  .card-kicker {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: .68rem;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .work-heading h2 { margin: .35rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.7rem); letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  .work-heading > a {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: .72rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }
  .work-heading > a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

  .portfolio-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }

  .project-card,
  .radar-card {
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform .24s ease, border-color .24s ease, box-shadow .24s ease;
  }
  .project-card:hover,
  .radar-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gold) 42%, var(--border));
    box-shadow: 0 20px 44px -32px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 45%, transparent);
  }

  .project-card { display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr; }
  .card-media { position: relative; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg); }
  .card-media img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: top center; transition: transform .45s ease; }
  .project-card:hover .card-media img { transform: scale(1.025); }
  .card-media--dewey { aspect-ratio: 16 / 8.7; }
  .card-media--dewey img { object-position: top left; }
  .card-media--groundline { aspect-ratio: 16 / 8.7; }
  .card-media--groundline img { object-position: center; }
  .comparison-preview { isolation: isolate; }
  .comparison-preview img { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
  .comparison-after { z-index: 1; clip-path: inset(0 0 0 48%); }
  .comparison-handle {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 3;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 48%;
    width: 2px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .94);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(12, 42, 37, .28);
  }
  .comparison-handle::after {
    content: '↔';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(12, 42, 37, .28);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
    color: #0B5A58;
    font-size: .78rem;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }
  .comparison-label { position: absolute; z-index: 4; bottom: .7rem; padding: .32rem .48rem; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(11, 35, 32, .76); color: #fff; font: 600 .58rem/1 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .comparison-label--before { left: .7rem; }
  .comparison-label--after { right: .7rem; }
  .card-groundline:hover .comparison-after { animation: comparison-reveal 2.8s ease-in-out infinite alternate; transform: none; }
  .card-groundline:hover .comparison-handle { animation: comparison-handle 2.8s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
  @keyframes comparison-reveal {
    from { clip-path: inset(0 0 0 88%); }
    to { clip-path: inset(0 0 0 12%); }
  }
  @keyframes comparison-handle {
    from { left: 88%; }
    to { left: 12%; }
  }
  .card-media--suno { aspect-ratio: 16 / 8; background: #090a0c; }
  .suno-preview-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  .suno-preview-grid video,
  .suno-preview-grid img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; filter: brightness(.78) saturate(.9); transition: filter .25s, transform .45s ease; }
  .card-suno:hover .suno-preview-grid video,
  .card-suno:hover .suno-preview-grid img { filter: brightness(.95) saturate(1); transform: scale(1.03); }

  .card-copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 1.2rem 1.25rem 1.35rem; }
  .card-title-row,
  .radar-title-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: start; gap: 1rem; }
  .card-title-row h2,
  .radar-title-row h2 { margin: .55rem 0 .4rem; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: -.035em; line-height: 1.12; }
  .card-title-row > span,
  .radar-title-row > span { color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.15rem; transform: translateY(.45rem); }
  .card-copy p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .project-card--feature .card-title-row h2 { font-size: 1.55rem; }
  .project-card--feature .card-copy p { max-width: 42rem; font-size: .92rem; }

  .card-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: .55rem 1rem;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 1.1rem;
  }
  .card-actions a {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: .64rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .05em;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .card-actions a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  .card-actions .card-action-primary {
    padding: .55rem .72rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--gold) 55%, var(--border));
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gold) 9%, transparent);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .card-groundline,
  .card-dewey { grid-column: span 7; }
  .card-permit { grid-column: span 5; }
  .card-brain,
  .card-toddlermaps,
  .card-suno,
  .card-music { grid-column: span 6; }
  .card-toddlermaps .card-media img { object-position: center; }
  .card-brain .card-media img { object-position: top left; }
  .permit-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: .65rem .9rem; margin: 1rem 0 0; padding: .9rem 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
